                "title": "IHG Hotels & Resorts unveils new premium collection brand, Noted Collection™",
                "url": "https://www.ihgplc.com/~/media/Files/I/Ihg-Plc/results/2026/full-year-2025/ihg-hotels-and-resorts-unveils-new-premium-collection-brand-noted-collection.pdf"
